# WET PAINT: a conker lets its spines go four ways the moment you line up
# with it; they fly to a wall, stun you and wreck other foes on the way.
# Bare, it is wrecked like any other.
game wetpaint
wait 5
cheat course 1
cheat nogarages
cheat noclock
cheat still
cheat go
cheat wipe
cheat car 20 7 2
cheat put conker 10 7 2
cheat put roller 14 7 2
wait 2
expect foe_0_armed == 0
expect shots >= 4
wait 30
expect foes_roller == 0
expect kills == 1
expect stuns == 1
wait 300
expect kills == 2
expect foes == 0
expect stuns == 1
